<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-specimen-match> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hamant et al. (2008), Bozorg et al. (2014), Sampathkumar et al. (2014), Uyttewaal et al. (2012), Heisler et al. (2010) & Louveaux et al. (2016) shoot apical meristem shell stress tensor, stress-vs-strain CMT alignment, katanin boundary morphogenesis and PIN1/CMT co-alignment on a growing L1 cellular vertex mesh — Morphological realism / specimen match: 64/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Judged on the regenerated 9-panel PNG and the two GIFs. Credited: Panel E overlays the segmented L1 contour and three ROIs on the SHA-256-locked Arabidopsis SAM section; Panels G-H show a cellular L1 patch whose polygonal cell packing, horizontal CMT bars in the stretched saddle patch and circumferential bars around the grey ablated cell with magenta PIN1 arrows pointing outward read like Heisler 2010's ablation panels and Hamant 2008 Fig. 3; the vertex GIF shows divisions accumulating. Deductions: there is still no side-by-side with any author figure (Hamant 2008 Fig. 2-3 CMT maps, Heisler 2010 PIN1-GFP, Louveaux 2016 division maps), so the resemblance is left to the viewer (-10); the vendored specimen is a longitudinal histological section whereas every mechanism modelled lives in the apical L1 surface, so Panel E/F compare section-plane wall-edge anisotropy with CMT order — a category mismatch that v2 scored as a match (-10); the dome patch (Panel I, 'Dome WT') shows S = 0.42 and visibly ordered CMT bars where the dome should be isotropic (reference 0.08) (-6); Panels A-D are unchanged phenomenological renderings (-4); the vertex-mesh panels have no scale bar or micron axis (-2); 'Distinct morphologies visually distinct' is satisfied (dome / saddle / ablation differ clearly) and credited." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py L1268–L1341: Specimen segmentation + structure-tensor coherency on a longitudinal section; measures wall-edge anisotropy in the section plane, not CMT/PIN1 organisation in the L1 surface <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py#L1268-L1341>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-specimen-match-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-specimen-match-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 6.4e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

